<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that day's faint wind blows away</font></font></b></font></font>

9
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kinou no haikyo ni uchi sutete</font></font></b></font></font>

10
00:00:34,180 --> 00:00:39,180
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">at the castle ruins of yesterday</font></font></b></font></font>

11
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kimi to warau ima wo ikiru no da</font></font></b></font></font>

12
00:00:39,180 --> 00:00:43,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">I'll laugh with you and live for the moment</font></font></b></font></font>

13
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">soredemo ano dekigoto ga kimi wo kurushimeru daro</font></font></b></font></font>

14
00:00:45,320 --> 00:00:53,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">still that incident will continue to trouble you, right?</font></font></b></font></font>

15
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">dakarakoso sayonara nanda</font></font></b></font></font>

16
00:00:53,000 --> 00:00:56,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">that's why it must be good-bye</font></font></b></font></font>

17
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">konomama nanimo nokorazu ni anata to wakachiau dake</font></font></b></font></font>

18
00:00:56,970 --> 00:01:04,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">leaving nothing behind, let us share what is left</font></font></b></font></font>

19
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yagate bokura wa sore ga subetee dato kigatsuite</font></font></b></font></font>

20
00:01:04,280 --> 00:01:11,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">in time, we'll realize that it was everything</font></font></b></font></font>

21
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">kanashimi wa hoo wo tsutatte namida no kawa ni naru dake</font></font></b></font></font>

22
00:01:11,320 --> 00:01:18,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">and sadness will touch our cheeks, creating a river of tears</font></font></b></font></font>

23
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23">{\an8}<font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">yureru omoi wa tsuyoi uzu ni n<font color="#ffffff">atte tokeau no yo</font></font></font></b></font></font>

24
00:01:18,490 --> 00:01:27,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="ShockTherapy BB"><b><font size="23"><font color="#ffffff">Trembling thoughts swept into a vortex and melting away</font></font></b></font></font>

25
00:01:32,030 --> 00:01:33,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

26
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,040
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Caught 'em!</font>

27
00:01:43,580 --> 00:01:46,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! All right!
I'll drag Sasuke back without fail!</font>

28
00:01:47,290 --> 00:01:49,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto! Hate to tell you this</font>

29
00:01:49,250 --> 00:01:52,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'm gonna demonstrate
my new Jutsu right here!</font>

30
00:01:53,590 --> 00:01:54,590
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Me too!</font>

31
00:01:55,670 --> 00:01:56,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Don't be so hasty.</font>

32
00:01:57,430 --> 00:02:00,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">As soon as preparations have been made
to implement my strategy...</font>

33
00:02:00,390 --> 00:02:02,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we'll make direct contact
with the target!</font>

34
00:02:06,180 --> 00:02:08,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It looks like they haven't
noticed us yet.</font>

35
00:02:10,980 --> 00:02:13,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh? Sasuke isn't there.</font>

36
00:02:16,110 --> 00:02:17,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It appears that...</font>

37
00:02:17,740 --> 00:02:19,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he's inside that "coffin."</font>

38
00:02:45,850 --> 00:02:47,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's this?</font>

39
00:02:47,230 --> 00:02:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I poked the bush for kicks</font>

40
00:02:49,020 --> 00:02:51,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and out comes not even a snake
but just two bugs.</font>

41
00:02:54,440 --> 00:02:56,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, wait a minute! Wait!</font>

42
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We didn't come here to fight.</font>

43
00:02:59,570 --> 00:03:01,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We just came here to negotiate!</font>

44
00:03:02,450 --> 00:03:03,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, then...</font>

45
00:03:03,780 --> 00:03:05,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What are they?!</font>

46
00:03:21,430 --> 00:03:24,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">There's no point
to that Smoke Bomb.</font>

47
00:03:24,180 --> 00:03:26,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You can't run away from me.</font>

48
00:03:27,180 --> 00:03:31,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's string that's thinner and stronger
than wire that you can hardly see.</font>

49
00:03:31,730 --> 00:03:34,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">My string is placed all over this place.</font>

50
00:03:36,150 --> 00:03:37,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn.</font>

51
00:03:38,650 --> 00:03:42,570
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Those two types of wires
on the trap were on purpose...</font>

52
00:03:43,700 --> 00:03:45,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was actually a triple trap.</font>

53
00:03:47,700 --> 00:03:48,950
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn.</font>

54
00:03:51,210 --> 00:03:53,880
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Didn't think they had one
with such ability in the group...</font>

55
00:03:56,960 --> 00:03:58,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You will be...!</font>

56
00:03:59,670 --> 00:04:01,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's going on...? My body...</font>

57
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:08,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Nice! Kiba, Shikamaru!</font>

58
00:04:09,680 --> 00:04:11,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shadow Possession Jutsu succeeded!</font>

59
00:04:13,560 --> 00:04:17,440
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But... There is one with
ability like this too.</font>

60
00:04:17,520 --> 00:04:20,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Thanks for getting caught so nicely
in my strategy.</font>

61
00:04:20,860 --> 00:04:24,410
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... But...</font>

62
00:04:24,780 --> 00:04:27,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I have this kind of ability too.</font>

63
00:04:30,540 --> 00:04:31,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where did it come from?</font>

64
00:04:32,660 --> 00:04:34,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Style Barrier!</font>

65
00:04:36,130 --> 00:04:37,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Earth Dome Prison!</font>

66
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:53,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Suddenly a Fight</font>

67
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:53,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Among The Group?!</font>

68
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:53,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">Shikamaru's Squad</font>

69
00:04:47,010 --> 00:04:53,020
<font face="Iwata Gyousho Pro-Kami B" size="45" color="#f5f5f5">in Big Danger</font>

70
00:05:10,410 --> 00:05:11,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

71
00:05:11,660 --> 00:05:12,500
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Where is this?</font>

72
00:05:12,910 --> 00:05:15,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Inside of that big guy's barrier.</font>

73
00:05:21,170 --> 00:05:22,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

74
00:05:29,390 --> 00:05:33,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These guys are mine.
I want to recover as much as possible.</font>

75
00:05:35,060 --> 00:05:37,100
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Once you're done eating,
catch up with us,</font>

76
00:05:37,190 --> 00:05:38,600
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">we're going ahead.</font>

77
00:05:45,950 --> 00:05:47,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Come quickly.</font>

78
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:51,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let us out! You!</font>

79
00:05:51,620 --> 00:05:53,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Be quiet, Naruto!</font>

80
00:05:57,000 --> 00:05:59,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">From the looks of it,
it just looks like a dirt wall...</font>

81
00:06:00,330 --> 00:06:05,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's their Jutsu,
there must be some kind of trap.</font>

82
00:06:08,130 --> 00:06:09,760
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I don't know what it's made of</font>

83
00:06:09,840 --> 00:06:12,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but we're just going to
have to tear this wall down!</font>

84
00:06:12,810 --> 00:06:15,140
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even though
it's dangerous to be careless,</font>

85
00:06:15,220 --> 00:06:18,480
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">it's actually more dangerous
to remain silent here.</font>

86
00:06:26,530 --> 00:06:27,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tunneling Fang!</font>

87
00:06:54,810 --> 00:06:57,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The wall is restoring itself...</font>

88
00:07:00,900 --> 00:07:01,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

89
00:07:02,020 --> 00:07:02,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I saw that.</font>

90
00:07:03,520 --> 00:07:05,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let us out!</font>

91
00:07:10,700 --> 00:07:13,740
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's not just a dirt wall after all.</font>

92
00:07:43,850 --> 00:07:45,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Byakugan!</font>

93
00:07:52,820 --> 00:07:54,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Th-This is...</font>

94
00:07:54,490 --> 00:07:56,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What is it? What's happening?</font>

95
00:08:15,550 --> 00:08:19,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This is bad.
Chakra's getting sucked up...</font>

96
00:08:23,520 --> 00:08:29,610
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn... I didn't expect that
they would just keep us in the barrier</font>

97
00:08:29,690 --> 00:08:32,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I didn't predict that
they would suck our Chakra either.</font>

98
00:08:40,620 --> 00:08:46,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Man. How dare they!
Let us out of here already!</font>

99
00:09:14,490 --> 00:09:18,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've had a good amount of Chakra.
Thank you for the meal.</font>

100
00:09:33,050 --> 00:09:36,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I feel like my body energy
is being sucked out.</font>

101
00:09:46,850 --> 00:09:49,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It won't be good if
we stay like this here, Shikamaru.</font>

102
00:09:50,690 --> 00:09:52,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It was careless to get caught</font>

103
00:09:52,900 --> 00:09:55,900
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">before we even figured out
our enemy's powers.</font>

104
00:09:56,570 --> 00:09:58,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of all that... inside here.</font>

105
00:10:03,040 --> 00:10:08,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! I'm going to make an air hole
before all my Chakra is gone!</font>

106
00:10:08,790 --> 00:10:09,670
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!</font>

107
00:10:11,960 --> 00:10:13,210
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The Food Pills!</font>

108
00:10:27,810 --> 00:10:30,060
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Akamaru!
Human Mimicry Ninja Art!</font>

109
00:10:31,900 --> 00:10:33,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">And for me
Beast Mimicry Ninja Art!</font>

110
00:10:48,160 --> 00:10:49,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Fang Over Fang!</font>

111
00:10:56,420 --> 00:10:58,510
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right! Good going Kiba.</font>

112
00:11:14,570 --> 00:11:16,280
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's useless...</font>

113
00:11:31,830 --> 00:11:35,540
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn! It starts to restore
the moment it's hit.</font>

114
00:11:38,050 --> 00:11:39,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Same with the ground.</font>

115
00:12:04,200 --> 00:12:06,780
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate we won't be able to
keep up for another ten minutes.</font>

116
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:09,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We'll lose all our Chakra
and be totally annihilated...</font>

117
00:12:28,390 --> 00:12:31,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I can't use the Rasengan that
requires extremely difficult Chakra control</font>

118
00:12:32,060 --> 00:12:34,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">especially in a place like this
that sucks the Chakra out of us.</font>

119
00:12:37,270 --> 00:12:38,400
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn!</font>

120
00:13:09,810 --> 00:13:13,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, I want you to listen to me!
I want to talk to your leader.</font>

121
00:13:14,940 --> 00:13:20,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">We won't go after Sasuke anymore
so let us out of here!</font>

122
00:13:20,360 --> 00:13:21,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey...</font>

123
00:13:21,610 --> 00:13:24,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru, what are you saying?</font>

124
00:13:26,280 --> 00:13:28,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Pleading for your life,
how interesting...</font>

125
00:13:29,160 --> 00:13:34,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But you guys are my prey
I can't let you out.</font>

126
00:13:35,330 --> 00:13:40,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then... just let me out on my own.</font>

127
00:13:46,300 --> 00:13:48,970
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">This battle...</font>

128
00:13:49,010 --> 00:13:50,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">is such a pain.</font>

129
00:13:51,100 --> 00:13:54,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You! Do you know
what you're saying?</font>

130
00:13:55,850 --> 00:13:58,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shut up Kiba, be quiet...</font>

131
00:13:59,100 --> 00:14:00,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

132
00:14:02,610 --> 00:14:03,980
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">A split in the group, huh?</font>

133
00:14:05,650 --> 00:14:07,700
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Seems like you're the leader but...</font>

134
00:14:07,780 --> 00:14:10,990
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't think you would be
the only one begging for your life!</font>

135
00:14:12,120 --> 00:14:16,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You really see a human's true nature
when one is pushed to the edge of death.</font>

136
00:14:17,410 --> 00:14:19,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You're such a low-life creature</font>

137
00:14:19,380 --> 00:14:23,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">you're not qualified to be responsible
for the lives of your platoon members.</font>

138
00:14:29,430 --> 00:14:31,930
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I've saved the most
important thing for last...</font>

139
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:36,890
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">To abandon Sasuke and
to even sell out on your own platoon...</font>

140
00:14:36,980 --> 00:14:39,230
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Is that what it means
to be a Chunin of the Leaf?</font>

141
00:14:41,400 --> 00:14:44,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Sasuke is a Shinobi of
the Village Hidden in the Leaves.</font>

142
00:14:44,360 --> 00:14:45,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He is a comrade!</font>

143
00:14:46,280 --> 00:14:48,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Therefore, I will put my life on the line
to help him!</font>

144
00:14:48,570 --> 00:14:50,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's the way of the Leaf Village.</font>

145
00:14:51,160 --> 00:14:55,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Someone like you deserves to die...
I won't let you out.</font>

146
00:14:55,200 --> 00:14:59,290
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! I believed in you
but now I've lost confidence in you!</font>

147
00:14:59,370 --> 00:15:00,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Let's take this outside!</font>

148
00:15:00,670 --> 00:15:02,380
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey, we can't get out!
You fool!</font>

149
00:15:02,460 --> 00:15:04,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's why we're in this situation!</font>

150
00:15:04,920 --> 00:15:06,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What do you mean by "fool"?</font>

151
00:15:06,130 --> 00:15:07,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm just speaking the truth, fool!</font>

152
00:15:07,340 --> 00:15:08,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Oh! You said "fool" again!</font>

153
00:15:09,220 --> 00:15:11,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Everybody be quiet for a second!</font>

154
00:15:15,100 --> 00:15:16,010
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji?</font>

155
00:15:30,400 --> 00:15:34,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Now he's squatting down.
What is he thinking?</font>

156
00:15:38,950 --> 00:15:42,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Hey! Why are you eating snacks
all of a sudden?!</font>

157
00:15:43,170 --> 00:15:45,790
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji binge eats when he gets upset...</font>

158
00:15:45,880 --> 00:15:48,800
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Jeez, another useless guy.</font>

159
00:15:49,260 --> 00:15:51,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It can't be helped!
In this case Shadow Clone...!</font>

160
00:15:51,760 --> 00:15:52,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Stop it.</font>

161
00:15:53,550 --> 00:15:56,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">The enemy's Chakra is placed
all over that wall.</font>

162
00:15:57,390 --> 00:16:01,390
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even if you are able to scratch it
the wall will restore itself right away.</font>

163
00:16:02,060 --> 00:16:04,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, it's useless
unless we can attack it</font>

164
00:16:04,860 --> 00:16:09,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">with a Taijutsu that has enough power
to destroy this wall with one blow.</font>

165
00:16:09,280 --> 00:16:12,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Somebody that has a Taijutsu
with greater destructive power than mine</font>

166
00:16:12,740 --> 00:16:14,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">would be Choji but...</font>

167
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:17,490
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">At this rate...</font>

168
00:16:24,960 --> 00:16:27,750
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Damn, what do we do!</font>

169
00:16:30,460 --> 00:16:34,220
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji... I'm sorry but can you use
the rest of the Chakra you have</font>

170
00:16:34,260 --> 00:16:38,640
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">to observe the wall behind you
and the wall behind Choji?</font>

171
00:16:39,430 --> 00:16:40,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I got it.</font>

172
00:16:40,560 --> 00:16:42,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Shikamaru! You be quiet!</font>

173
00:16:42,850 --> 00:16:43,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Naruto!</font>

174
00:16:43,810 --> 00:16:45,350
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">You still don't understand?!</font>

175
00:16:45,440 --> 00:16:48,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Remember what Shikamaru said
when he gathered everyone!</font>

176
00:16:51,280 --> 00:16:56,200
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Even I can't just sit back and be lazy.</font>

177
00:16:56,280 --> 00:16:59,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because I'm responsible
for your lives.</font>

178
00:17:00,200 --> 00:17:03,620
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, don't raise your voice
too much from here.</font>

179
00:17:03,710 --> 00:17:08,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Kiba, dent that wall
behind Neji and Choji again!</font>

180
00:17:08,840 --> 00:17:10,340
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Y-Yeah...</font>

181
00:17:12,340 --> 00:17:14,550
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! I don't fully understand
what's going on</font>

182
00:17:14,680 --> 00:17:16,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">but I'll go wild one more time!</font>

183
00:17:18,350 --> 00:17:19,470
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Tunneling Fang!</font>

184
00:17:24,310 --> 00:17:27,520
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh! No matter how hard you try
it's useless!</font>

185
00:17:52,460 --> 00:17:53,840
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Huh, I see...</font>

186
00:17:53,960 --> 00:17:55,170
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">It's over there.</font>

187
00:17:58,340 --> 00:17:59,260
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Neji!</font>

188
00:18:00,010 --> 00:18:02,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Mark that spot with the Kunai Knife.</font>

189
00:18:03,060 --> 00:18:05,560
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji, are you ready?!</font>

190
00:18:06,180 --> 00:18:08,190
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Okay! Any time!</font>

191
00:18:08,440 --> 00:18:10,650
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, let's do this.</font>

192
00:18:10,980 --> 00:18:12,940
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What's happening?!</font>

193
00:18:13,440 --> 00:18:18,320
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Like I said earlier,
the wall's surface is planted with Chakra.</font>

194
00:18:19,240 --> 00:18:25,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">But even this tough wall could have
an area that has a thin layer of Chakra.</font>

195
00:18:25,540 --> 00:18:27,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That is what Shikamaru speculated.</font>

196
00:18:28,960 --> 00:18:32,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">How... How did you get all of that?</font>

197
00:18:32,840 --> 00:18:35,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Think about what happened earlier.</font>

198
00:18:36,470 --> 00:18:39,720
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Because he noticed that
there were areas that restored quickly</font>

199
00:18:39,760 --> 00:18:42,680
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and others that didn't so quickly</font>

200
00:18:42,720 --> 00:18:45,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">when Kiba and Akamaru attacked
the wall surface.</font>

201
00:18:52,230 --> 00:18:55,110
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">In other words, he guessed that
those areas that didn't restore quickly</font>

202
00:18:55,190 --> 00:18:56,820
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">probably have a thin layer
of Chakra.</font>

203
00:18:58,650 --> 00:19:02,660
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">On top of all that
by cleverly talking to the enemy</font>

204
00:19:02,740 --> 00:19:06,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">he figured out the position
of the enemy outside of the wall.</font>

205
00:19:08,910 --> 00:19:12,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">He guessed that
the wall furthest from the enemy</font>

206
00:19:13,040 --> 00:19:16,460
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">probably had the thinnest point
of Chakra</font>

207
00:19:16,550 --> 00:19:19,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">so that's what he wanted to confirm.</font>

208
00:19:20,680 --> 00:19:22,050
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">That's what it is, correct?</font>

209
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:29,810
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I see, in order to trick the enemy
you must trick your friends first.</font>

210
00:19:29,890 --> 00:19:33,770
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I didn't see that there was
such a plan behind that conversation.</font>

211
00:19:34,860 --> 00:19:38,030
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Then Choji realized the plan</font>

212
00:19:38,110 --> 00:19:41,360
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">and the reason why he was eating
was to replenish his Chakra.</font>

213
00:19:43,160 --> 00:19:44,370
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">These two...</font>

214
00:19:44,450 --> 00:19:48,450
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">They haven't been working together
as a team all these years for nothing.</font>

215
00:19:49,000 --> 00:19:50,830
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">I'm depending on you, Choji.</font>

216
00:19:50,910 --> 00:19:51,920
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Yeah!</font>

217
00:19:53,880 --> 00:19:55,630
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Expansion Jutsu!</font>

218
00:19:56,590 --> 00:19:58,960
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">All right, let's go!</font>

219
00:20:06,430 --> 00:20:08,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Human Boulder!</font>

220
00:20:32,120 --> 00:20:33,120
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">What?!</font>

221
00:20:52,730 --> 00:20:58,860
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="32">Choji... You are awesome after all!</font>

