<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="23"><font face="Oravetica"><font color="#ffffff"><b></b></font></font></font>

256
00:22:38,120 --> 00:22:40,580
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Huh? What are you saying
all of a sudden, Choji!</font>

257
00:22:40,670 --> 00:22:42,420
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">There's no way that's possible!</font>

258
00:22:42,450 --> 00:22:44,090
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But Choji is right.</font>

259
00:22:44,170 --> 00:22:46,070
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">If we keep lagging we won't be able
to catch up with Sasuke.</font>

260
00:22:46,100 --> 00:22:47,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">But still...</font>

261
00:22:47,050 --> 00:22:48,850
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Don't worry. I have an idea.</font>

262
00:22:48,900 --> 00:22:50,430
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Choji, are you possibly thinking...</font>

263
00:22:50,500 --> 00:22:52,000
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Do you have a plan or something?</font>

264
00:22:52,050 --> 00:22:52,300
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Yeah.</font>

265
00:22:52,390 --> 00:22:53,330
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Hey! Choji!</font>

266
00:22:53,400 --> 00:22:56,730
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">That's right!
I have that secret weapon of mine!</font>

267
00:22:57,060 --> 00:23:00,270
<font face="DeschTypeMercurius-Medium" size="30">Next time:
"Full Power! Burn, Choji!"</font>

268
